// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (git-ignored) and fill in the keys Reel ships with.
// Write the bare value, no quotes (xcconfig keeps them). They reach the app through Info.plist at build time; a user's own key typed into Settings
// overrides the built-in one. Leave a value empty to ship without that service.
//
//   TMDB:          themoviedb.org → account → Settings → API → "API Key" (the v3 key, 32 hex chars)
//   fanart.tv:     fanart.tv/get-an-api-key → project key
//   OpenSubtitles: opensubtitles.com → API consumers → consumer API key
REEL_TMDB_KEY =
REEL_FANART_KEY =
REEL_OPENSUBTITLES_KEY =
